<title>USA: NYSE May short interest rises 133.4 mln shares.</title>
<headline>NYSE May short interest rises 133.4 mln shares.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New York Stock Exchange said Wednesday that short interest in the month ended May 15 rose 133.4 million shares to an all-time record of 3.28 billion shares.</p>
<p>The exchange said that short interest in the previous month, ended April 15, totaled 3.15 billion shares.</p>
